  <h2>Common allergens in dim sum</h2>
  <p>
    Dim sum is often made with wheat, soy, egg, sesame, shellfish and fish, and some sauces contain peanuts or other
    nuts. Our kitchen prepares many dishes side by side, so we can't guarantee any dish is free from traces of allergens.
  </p>

